#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "C11, POSIX.1-2008."
msgstr "C11, POSIX.1-2008."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "HISTORY"
msgstr "HISTÓRICO"

#.  POSIX.1 (1996 edition) requires only the
#.  .BR abs ()
#.  function.
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "POSIX.1-2001, C99, SVr4, 4.3BSD."
msgstr "POSIX.1-2001, C99, SVr4, 4.3BSD."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"C89 only includes the B<abs>()  and B<labs>()  functions; the functions "
"B<llabs>()  and B<imaxabs>()  were added in C99."
msgstr ""
"C89 só inclui as funções B<abs>() e B<labs>(); as funções B<llabs>() e "
"B<imaxabs> foram adicionas em C99."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTES"
msgstr "NOTAS"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Trying to take the absolute value of the most negative integer is not "
"defined."
msgstr ""
"O resultado do valor absoluto do inteiro mais negativo possível não está "
"definido."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<llabs>()  function is included since glibc 2.0.  The B<imaxabs>()  "
"function is included since glibc 2.1.1."
msgstr ""
"A função B<llabs>() é incluída desde o glibc 2.0. A função B<imaxabs>() é "
"incluída desde o glibc 2.1.1."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"For B<llabs>()  to be declared, it may be necessary to define "
"B<_ISOC99_SOURCE> or B<_ISOC9X_SOURCE> (depending on the version of glibc) "
"before including any standard headers."
msgstr ""
"Para B<llabs>() ser declarada, pode ser necessário definir B<_ISOC99_SOURCE> "
"ou B<_ISOC9X_SOURCE> (dependendo da versão da glibc) antes da inclusão de "
"qualquer cabeçalho padrão."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"By default, GCC handles B<abs>(), B<labs>(), and (since GCC 3.0)  "
"B<llabs>()  and B<imaxabs>()  as built-in functions."
msgstr ""
"Por padrão, GCC manipula B<abs>(), B<labs>(), e (desde o GCC 3.0) B<llabs>() "
"e B<imaxabs>() como funções internas."

